{
    "background_story": "Aylin was a self-proclaimed coffee aficionado, with a passion that rivaled the most discerning connoisseurs. Growing up in a small caf\u00e9 owned by her family, she was surrounded by the rich aromas and flavors of expertly brewed coffee from a young age. As she traveled the world, Aylin sought out the most exotic and rare coffee beans, experimenting with roasting techniques and brewing methods. Her friends and family would often joke that she could detect even the subtlest notes in a cup. Aylin's dedication to the art of coffee led her to open her own specialty coffee shop, where she shared her knowledge and love with the community. Coffee aficionados from far and wide would flock to her shop, eager to taste her latest creations and learn from the master herself.",
